<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ dwelling permits fall 12.2 pct in February.</title>
<headline>NZ dwelling permits fall 12.2 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand said on Friday that an estimated 1,677 new dwelling units were authorised for construciton in February, down 12.2 percent on February 1996.  </p>
<p>SNZ said its trend estimate for the number of new dwelling unit authorisations had levelled off. The estimate had increased over the previous four months.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
